'''Lake Slowpoke''' (Japanese: '''ヤドン湖''' ''{{tt|Yadon|Slowpoke}}'' Lake), also known as '''Lake Enlightenment''', is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Johto]] located between [[Mahogany Town]] and [[Blackthorn City]]. It appeared in ''[[EP244|Enlighten Up!]]''.

{{Ash}}, {{an|Misty}}, and {{an|Brock}} arrived here when they were suddenly confronted by {{TRT}}. They started a battle, but were interrupted by a {{p|Slowpoke}}, which was revealed to belong to {{OBP|Madeleine|EP244}}, a student of the [[Slowpoke Temple]] that lies close to Lake Slowpoke.

After visiting the temple, Ash, Brock, Misty, and Madeleine returned to the lakeside were Misty wanted to [[Fishing|fish]]. When Team Rocket stole the golden Slowpoke statue of the Slowpoke Temple and came rushing down towards the lake, Madeleine's Slowpoke [[Evolution|evolved]] into {{p|Slowbro}} after catching a {{p|Shellder}} with its tail. Slowbro managed to return the statue and defeat Team Rocket.
{{-}}

